// Embeds the engine's icon into TartarusEngine.exe itself (Windows reads resource ID 1's icon
// for taskbar/Explorer/shortcut display). Baked into every build via CMakeLists.txt, so a
// desktop shortcut that targets the exe directly keeps showing this icon across rebuilds
// without any extra setup — nothing outside the repo needs to be re-pointed after an update.
IDI_ICON1 ICON "tartarus_icon.ico"
